  "findings": [
    "Exact five-row offer requires all four maintained additions and byte-equal original native ledger; only two runtime modules are copied into an exclusive private runtime.",
    "Twelve CLI cases use independently prepared complete stdout bytes. Actual 16MiB/per-file and 100000-row boundaries are represented; unsupported summary years remain discoverable and occurrence counts are not deduplicated.",
