    "V2 captures complete immediate fixture namespace including missing.json absence before and after; ordinary source/control/runtime identities and runtime file set are preserved.",
    "V2 terminates and reaps its owned session child on interrupted wait, with TERM then bounded KILL fallback, records the interrupted attempt and prospective streams, and propagates into a failed receipt. Normal child timeout/residual-group cleanup cannot pass acceptance.",
    "All twelve cases, argv, expected outputs, helpers and prior freeze remain unchanged; patch body exactly reconstructs the reviewed V2."
